# Last matching pattern wins. A pattern with no owner means "no code owner
# review required" for those paths.

* @sjseth

# Dependency manifests: Renovate's minor/patch bumps touch only these two
# files, so exempting them lets a PR with green required checks automerge
# without a code-owner approval. A PR that also touches any other file still
# needs review. .github/workflows/ is deliberately NOT exempted -- workflows
# run with repo secrets, so action bumps (including Renovate's) stay gated.
/pyproject.toml
/uv.lock
